      "dimension": "Shutdown Order",
      "recommendation": "Cancel heartbeat context before other shutdown signals in worker.Stop()",
      "rationale": "Ensures in-flight heartbeats are canceled before worker begins tearing down other components, preventing hangs during shutdown.",
      "alternatives_considered": [
        "Canceling after other shutdown steps (risk of blocked shutdown)",
        "Canceling concurrently with other steps (race condition)",
        "Not canceling at all (status quo with known issues)"
